THE PLATFORM IS PROVIDED "AS IS."

THE PLATFORM OWNER DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, OR PERFORMANCE.

USE OF THE PLATFORM IS AT THE USER'S OWN RISK.

